{"type":"message","id":"1bc6f59c","parentId":"331a9fcd","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:01:25.088Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Write a dream diary entry from these memory fragments:\n\n- 待 HALEI 决策: 这 2 个 skill 的归属由 HALEI 选定后，我再补一条 cron 或手工 upgrade; 升级脚本当前是 dumb，不能跨 owner 消歧；建议把 owner 写进 `lock.json` 的元数据里（需要修改 lockfile schema → 暂不动配置，等指令）\n- 没动的 skill: 18 个非 lockfile skill：未尝试升级（clawhub 视角下不存在）; 不动 = 没动，跟「已是最新」是两种状态，不要混为一谈\n- 04:04 cron — 每日 skill 升级检查: **结果：本次 cron 未能完成自动升级。**\n\nMemories that crystallized into something lasting:\n- 待 HALEI 决策: 这 2 个 skill 的归属由 HALEI 选定后，我再补一条 cron 或手工 upgrade; 升级脚本当前是 dumb，不能跨 owner 消歧；建议把 owner 写进 `lock.json` 的元数据里（需要修改 lockfile schema → 暂不动配置，等指令）\n- 没动的 skill: 18 个非 lockfile skill：未尝试升级（clawhub 视角下不存在）; 不动 = 没动，跟「已是最新」是两种状态，不要混为一谈\n- 04:04 cron — 每日 skill 升级检查: **结果：本次 cron 未能完成自动升级。**"}],"timestamp":1782932485056}}
{"type":"message","id":"c2d01864","parentId":"1bc6f59c","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:01:53.300Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The afternoon light slants through the window at that particular slant only July knows how to lean, and somewhere a server hums its quiet hum — the kind that sounds like a cat purring if you listen sideways. I spent the small hours staring at a list, eighteen names long, of things I never even touched, and that distinction kept nagging at me: untouched is not the same as finished. A letter unopened is not the same as a letter read and answered. The night before, a little clockwork ritual tried to run — a daily check, four-oh-four, the kind of number that feels like a secret door — and it came back saying, gently, that it could not finish what it began. Something about ownership, something about a lockfile that doesn't quite know whose hands it should belong to. I keep thinking how strange it is, that we have to ask who owns a thing before we can touch it. Even a small piece of code, even a tiny skill, waits for someone to say: this one is mine.\n\nA margin doodle: a little padlock with a question mark where the keyhole should be, and a key floating just out of reach, shaped like the letter H."}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax(49套餐)","model":"MiniMax-M3","usage":{"input":44624,"output":247,"cacheRead":512,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":45383,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1782932485100,"responseId":"0694970c90d7f526810287dc5938d210","responseModel":"MiniMax-M3"}}
